	(text "[ ] U9 AVR128DA48 pin map: TWI0 PA2/PA3, USART0 PA0/PA1 (CP2102N), USART1 PC0/PC1 (J10), ADC PD0-PD2,\n     BAND_A PA5 / BAND_B PA6, D4 PA7, SYNC LED PC2, GPS USART3 DEFAULT PB0 TX / PB1 RX; firmware must follow.\n[x] GPS_PPS on PF2 (fully async pin): EVSYS CHANNEL4/5 gen 0x4A -> USERTCB0CAPT (DS 21.5, 16.3.4).\n[ ] CAL_CLK (Si5351C CLK4 via R47 33R) on PB2 (async, EVSYS CH0/1 gen 0x4A) -> TCB0 COUNT;\n     TCB0 OVF -> TCB1 COUNT (CASCADE), PPS CAPT on both = 32-bit count per 10 s gate (DS 22.3.3.3).\n[ ] SI_INTR (Si5351C INTR, open drain, R46 10k pull-up) on PB3; BTN_DSP_1 on PE0.\n[ ] Y1: CL 12.5 pF, C41/C42 15p assumes 5 pF pin + ~2 pF stray (XOSC32K LPMODE=0);\n     trim after measuring the 32 kHz error.\n[x] TX LED D12 (KT-0603YG) + R39 470R hang off the TX net (PA4); ~3 mA, no extra MCU pin.\n[x] D10/R35 UPDI diode + 470R identical to Si5351AVFO J5 and EtherKeyerMini J3.\n[ ] Q6/Q7 AO3400A drive the 6-relay tree (Q6 2 coils ~42 mA, Q7 4 coils ~84 mA); Q8/Q9 removed.\n[ ] +5V now from USB-C VBUS only (500 mA default USB); PA draw not yet measured.\n[x] U1 FB tied to VIN: Jason: FB tied to VIN selects internal 12 V output (TLV61046A datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "789fbba8-097a-443d-a95b-4475d320b5a1")
	)
